                  <div>
                    <h2 class="h1"><span class="span-pink-2">Project overview</span></h2>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-16-150 opacity-80">Sharpish.co is a dynamic and innovative website that aims to revolutionize the way people access and engage with information. <a href="/for-whom/startup" class="link-9">Sharpish.co serves as a hub for a wide range of topics</a>, providing users with curated content that is both informative and entertaining. We supported them with a <a href="/services/2d-animation" class="link-21">2D animation</a>
                  <a href="/services/explainer-video" class="link-22"> explainer video</a> and <a href="/services/social-media" class="link-23">social media conten</a>t to help communicate their platform in a more engaging way.<br>
                </div>
